{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659818",
      "title": "Reducing State Management & Identifying Unnecessary State",
      "sourceHash": "1c8860472c61f8e4a75c32d14337759642da7c435bd0946cd2a974b7999cce33",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.78,
          "end": 2.43,
          "en": "Now, in the last lectures,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.43,
          "end": 6.81,
          "en": "we made sure that we compute this gameboard value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.81,
          "end": 9.27,
          "en": "based on this gameTurns state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.27,
          "end": 11.46,
          "en": "that's managed in the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.46,
          "end": 16.29,
          "en": "and that's passed through props to the Gameboard component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.29,
          "end": 19.38,
          "en": "Before we continue adding more features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.38,
          "end": 22.74,
          "en": "let's take another look at this app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.74,
          "end": 26.7,
          "en": "Is there something else we could compute here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.7,
          "end": 31.7,
          "en": "Maybe something we're currently managing as state?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.04,
          "end": 34.53,
          "en": "Well, since I'm asking that way, yes there is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.53,
          "end": 37.23,
          "en": "It's this activePlayer state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.23,
          "end": 40.68,
          "en": "At the moment, we are managing this as state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.68,
          "end": 43.08,
          "en": "And if you just glance at this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.08,
          "end": 45,
          "en": "this also makes a lot of sense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45,
          "end": 46.17,
          "en": "right after all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.17,
          "end": 49.59,
          "en": "the player needs to change after every turn.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.59,
          "end": 52.95,
          "en": "And we need to update the UI when that happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.95,
          "end": 56.31,
          "en": "because, for example, this highlighting box needs to change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.31,
          "end": 59.43,
          "en": "and the symbol that gets placed in these boxes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.43,
          "end": 61.65,
          "en": "also needs to change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.65,
          "end": 63.78,
          "en": "So a UI update is needed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.78,
          "end": 68.28,
          "en": "hence managing this as state makes sense, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.28,
          "end": 69.24,
          "en": "No.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.24,
          "end": 73.17,
          "en": "Because yes, we need state to trigger a UI update,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.17,
          "end": 74.49,
          "en": "but let's not forget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.49,
          "end": 78.03,
          "en": "that we already have this gameTurns state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.03,
          "end": 82.05,
          "en": "which already changes whenever a box is selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.05,
          "end": 84.48,
          "en": "so whenever a button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.48,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "So we definitely don't need this activePlayer state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 91.68299999999999,
          "en": "just to trigger a UI update when that happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.61,
          "end": 94.65,
          "en": "But, of course, we need information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.65,
          "end": 97.95,
          "en": "regarding which player is the active player,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.95,
          "end": 102.47999999999999,
          "en": "but we can also get this information from our gameTurns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.47999999999999,
          "end": 105.3,
          "en": "And indeed, that's exactly what we're already doing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.3,
          "end": 107.46000000000001,
          "en": "here in this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.46000000000001,
          "end": 110.46000000000001,
          "en": "We're passing to set gameTurns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.46000000000001,
          "end": 114.53999999999999,
          "en": "Here, we are deriving the activePlayer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.53999999999999,
          "end": 119.163,
          "en": "for this turn state update based on the previous turn.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.3,
          "end": 122.13,
          "en": "And, of course, we could do the same here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.13,
          "end": 124.2,
          "en": "in the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.2,
          "end": 128.28,
          "en": "Instead of having a dedicated activePlayer state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.28,
          "end": 133.28,
          "en": "which is updated here, we could add some derived state here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.59,
          "end": 136.68,
          "en": "and we can essentially copy the logic from here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.68,
          "end": 140.16,
          "en": "with the difference being that now here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.16,
          "end": 141.6,
          "en": "in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.6,
          "end": 145.02,
          "en": "we're not getting the current player information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.02,
          "end": 148.29,
          "en": "based on some old gameTurns state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.29,
          "end": 152.37,
          "en": "but instead we want to use the current gameTurns state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.37,
          "end": 156.123,
          "en": "So here we replace prevTurns with gameTurns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.73,
          "end": 161.79,
          "en": "But with that, we're then arriving the symbol",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.79,
          "end": 165.873,
          "en": "of the currently active player from gameTurns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.4,
          "end": 170.13,
          "en": "Now even though the code is pretty much the same as here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.13,
          "end": 173.55,
          "en": "this does not allow us to get rid of this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.55,
          "end": 176.7,
          "en": "because here inside of this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.7,
          "end": 179.25,
          "en": "which we pass to setGameTurns,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.25,
          "end": 184.25,
          "en": "we need to derive the state from the old gameTurns state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.26,
          "end": 186.33,
          "en": "whereas here in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 186.33,
          "end": 189.54,
          "en": "we're deriving it from the current gameTurns state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.54,
          "end": 191.46,
          "en": "For the reasons I mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 195.06,
          "en": "where when you update state based on old state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.06,
          "end": 196.983,
          "en": "you should update it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.69,
          "end": 201.69,
          "en": "But, of course, what we can do is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.69,
          "end": 204.12,
          "en": "we can create a helper function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 204.12,
          "end": 206.07,
          "en": "outside of the component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.07,
          "end": 209.94,
          "en": "because this helper function will not need any access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.94,
          "end": 214.44,
          "en": "to the state or any other data related to the component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 214.44,
          "end": 217.11,
          "en": "And it also shouldn't be recreated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 217.11,
          "end": 219.78300000000002,
          "en": "when the component function re-executes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.95,
          "end": 224.31,
          "en": "We could name it deriveActivePlayer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 224.31,
          "end": 227.71,
          "en": "and as an input, I want to get my gameTurns",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 228.72,
          "end": 231.123,
          "en": "as a simple standard parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 232.17000000000002,
          "end": 235.38,
          "en": "And then we can copy this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 235.38,
          "end": 237.23,
          "en": "paste it here into deriveActivePlayer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 238.07999999999998,
          "end": 240.603,
          "en": "and return currentPlayer here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 242.85,
          "end": 245.7,
          "en": "And with this helper function defined here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 245.7,
          "end": 248.29,
          "en": "we can go back to our component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.27,
          "end": 251.43,
          "en": "and now replace this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 251.43,
          "end": 253.54,
          "en": "with a constant named currentPlayer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.46,
          "end": 257.46,
          "en": "or activePlayer, whatever you want to name it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 257.46,
          "end": 262.17,
          "en": "which holds the result of calling deriveActivePlayer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 262.17,
          "end": 264.54,
          "en": "So this function which we just added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 264.54,
          "end": 267.72,
          "en": "and we just pass our state gameTurns",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 267.72,
          "end": 272.19,
          "en": "as an argument like this to deriveActivePlayer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 272.19,
          "end": 275.79,
          "en": "so that in there, it is available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 275.79,
          "end": 278.613,
          "en": "That's how this is all related and works together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 279.87,
          "end": 282.36,
          "en": "And with that, we got the activePlayer here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 282.36,
          "end": 285.84000000000003,
          "en": "And, of course, now in this state updating function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 285.84000000000003,
          "end": 287.77,
          "en": "we can also replace this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 289.17,
          "end": 292.383,
          "en": "and set our currentPlayer by calling deriveActivePlayer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 293.67,
          "end": 296.19,
          "en": "But now we don't pass gameTurns",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 296.19,
          "end": 300.183,
          "en": "as an argument to this function, but prevTurns in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 301.95,
          "end": 305.283,
          "en": "And with that, we also got rid of that code duplication.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 308.127,
          "end": 310.95,
          "en": "And now with that, we still got the activePlayer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 310.95,
          "end": 314.31,
          "en": "but we got it without managing some extra state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 314.31,
          "end": 317.34,
          "en": "And that's really what you should go for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 317.34,
          "end": 319.56,
          "en": "when writing React code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 319.56,
          "end": 323.01,
          "en": "You wanna manage as little state as possible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 323.01,
          "end": 327.33299999999997,
          "en": "and derive and compute as many values as needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 328.41,
          "end": 331.473,
          "en": "With that, if we save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 333.39,
          "end": 335.07,
          "en": "you see we got no error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 335.07,
          "end": 339.663,
          "en": "and I can still click these buttons and play this game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 340.59000000000003,
          "end": 343.08,
          "en": "And with that, it's now time to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 343.08,
          "end": 345.99,
          "en": "that we can't click the same button multiple times",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 345.99,
          "end": 347.52,
          "en": "as we currently can.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 347.52,
          "end": 349.56,
          "en": "And, of course, then we also want to check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 349.56,
          "end": 350.973,
          "en": "whether the game is over.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}